[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i11"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天也是一如既往的广播体操。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然根本提不起劲来，但今天是全勤奖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未也像是执行某项规定一样地来到了神社。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15360"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然无精打采的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，她会不会觉得只要一切都按照平常的那样，白羽也会一如往常般的来陪她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那既然如此，我也表现得像平常那样吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“伸展运动～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咦？这么正常的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然就变得不同寻常了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这是连我都知道的正常广播体操。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那些奇怪的运动上哪里去了？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"更重要的是，今天领操大哥哥的情绪异常低落。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“听说大叔被甩了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知从何处传来了这样一句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“深～……，呼吸～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"特喜欢广播操的小哥","text":"“哎～……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我不要一大早就经历这么负能量的广播体操……"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i61"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到家吃完早饭。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"换做平时的话，白羽已经来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而今天却没有看见她的身影。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15369"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未面露不安，满心期待地等着白羽的到来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽是真的不愿再做她的妈妈了吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15442"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈不来吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……今天她肯定是有事吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连我自己都觉得这个谎言太蹩脚。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15436"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未看上去似乎没有相信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是却什么都没说。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"罪恶感令心中刺痛。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要不要出门散散步？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“一直待在这里也会无聊的吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也想散散心。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15485"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“唔唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但羽未却摇了摇头。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈要是来了就不好了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她还在担心白羽到来时的情况吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说不定我们会在路上遇见呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“先出门去看看吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"其实压根就没指望在外面能偶遇白羽这种事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是为了让羽未点头而采取的权宜之计。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15579"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未总算是答应了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我真是狡猾的大人。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都走了这么远了，羽未还是左顾右盼地寻找着白羽的身影，根本就没有安分下来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样一来根本就不能算是散心了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"必须得做点能哄羽未开心的事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好，我们去那里吧。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“欢迎光临。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我们顺道过来看看。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10224"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“咦，今天羽未也一起呀？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，稍微出门散散步。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10233"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“感觉你真的像个爸爸一样了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“那今天妈妈……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10177"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我一步冲上前，用手捂住了她的嘴。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……――呃唔唔！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（嘘……、今天禁止提‘妈妈’。）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10163"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"（噗哈……啊？你做了什么？）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（老实说……我也不知道。）"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10190"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"（喂……你离得太近了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"（啊，抱歉。）"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15809"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……小三…？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10139"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍·羽依里","text":"“不是！”“不是！”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i158"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们澄清着误会，同时给羽未做了一份刨冰。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随后，我和苍在稍远的地方谈了起来。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10163"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你真的没有头绪吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这就是最让我头疼的地方了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10273"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10244"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我还以为你会带来某种改变呢……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我记得你之前说过一句耐人寻味的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说这些事必须由白羽自己开口说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10228"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你还记得啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽也说了令人在意的话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……好像是…我被诅咒了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10190"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“……是吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗？看来你果然知道些什么吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能告诉我吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10185"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为什么？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“什么叫为什么……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10214"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是为了羽未？还是为了白羽？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个嘛――……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"为了羽未","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"为了白羽","value":1,"condition":1},{"text":"为了自己","value":2,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":153,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为了羽未。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想在这个暑假给她留下美好的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她说她是逃避而来的，虽然没问她究竟在逃避什么。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是她却对我说，这个夏天她不想逃避了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……目光十分地真挚。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以……我才想要去回应她……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"哪怕我自己也是逃避而来的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，正因为我是逃避而来的，所以才会在羽未身上找到了许多共同之处。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10211"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔……这个嘛，毕竟从白羽的角度来说，这些都是你自己的问题。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你这么一说……我确实无言以对。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为在我的心中已经排好了优先顺序……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10216"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“但为了小孩子的这个举动，却没有做错。”"},{"op":"goto","target":192},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":173,"value":["==",["v",6001],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为了白羽。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“为了白羽？什么意思？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“虽然不知道为什么，但她一直避免与人接触吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是看着她和羽未相处的这段时间，我认为。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她心里其实是很想和别人在一起的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你也说过看到白羽那么开心的样子，感到很欣慰对吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10309"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是的，因为那样的白羽，就连我们也很少见了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“既然如此，就算是以和羽未的相处为契机也好。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也希望白羽能多绽放出一些笑容。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10306"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“哇啊啊――……该怎么说呢，大城市的人真是会装模作样！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你说这些话不会难为情的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……还是会有一点的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10216"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过能把这些话说出口，其实也蛮帅气的。”"},{"op":"goto","target":192},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为了自己。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10320"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不要一脸凶相地瞪着我嘛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10312"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“明明只有两个选项，你怎么就变出第三个来的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃……说是为了白羽或是羽未的话，感觉有些虚伪了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“看着羽未和白羽在一起的时候。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我自己也感觉很高兴。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为我来这里……是为了逃避某些烦心的事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是看着她们俩，就感觉我还能挽回某些东西。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我希望羽未和白羽，都能觉得这个在暑假留下了美好的回忆。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不是二者择一。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“而是两者皆有。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不然的话，就感觉我依然还是个空壳……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10342"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“什么嘛，不就是单纯的贪心吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10211"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“更应该说，你真是个烂好人呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10272"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔～……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10265"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“要不，你还是再去找白羽谈谈吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我确实也想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但又不能留羽未一个人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“留她在这里，我帮你照顾吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10200"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“再过一会儿，良一他们也该来了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“这店里的东西，随她吃随她玩。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你这么好心的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“事后要结账哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……嗯，我想也是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那……羽未就拜托你了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你就放心吧！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15809"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我去找找白羽。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15798"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对，你的妈妈。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“所以，你能在这里等我一会儿吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15870"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15874"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“会……回来吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，我会努力把妈妈带回来的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15856"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……不……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知为何她却摇了摇头。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15863"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“爸爸……会回来吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"超乎意料的一句话，让我一时语塞。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为什么孩子在这种问题上如此敏感呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着说着就两眼含泪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“放心，我一定会回来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在那之前，你就先留在这里。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍和良一他们会陪你玩的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10196"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“想吃什么点心尽管拿。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“只要给我的钱包留一口气就行了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15875"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……好的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未两眼通红地点了点头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好，接下来只需要找到白羽了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是……她会在哪里呢……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎啦嘎啦嘎啦"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11339"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“买东西啦～”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10115"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，欢迎光临，要三角形的秘密？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11326"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥？你还在岛上啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"倒不如说，她都变成熟客了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11288"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“我的夏日寻宝正进行得如荼如火呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15794"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未睁大了双眼。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11336"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“啊，羽未也在呀。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15904"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……小三…一号。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未指着鸥说道。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i10246"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉？什么情况？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“……小三…二号。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着，羽未又指着苍说道。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11352"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“哎呀呀，原来是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15801"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽未","text":"“妈妈……修罗场……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“都说不是啦！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11355"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不是吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“拜托别把事情搞复杂了好吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11291"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“……咦？感觉气氛有些凝重呢，抱歉抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来鸥还是多少懂得察言观色的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11333"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“不过气氛凝重的原因似乎是妈妈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随即又立马说出了禁忌词……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你怎么知道的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11329"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“因为感觉白羽小姐情绪很低落。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你在哪里看见她的!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11293"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“唉？呃……就在那边。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确认了一下鸥所指的方向。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那边是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽经常独处的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"常去钓鱼的那个好地方吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“鸥，多谢了！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“妙翠角算我的！苍，记在我的账上。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11266"},{"op":"text","speaker":"鸥","text":"“请把店里所有的妙翠角都给我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……没想到你下手还挺狠的啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但让我知道了白羽的位置确实是大功一件。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“羽未，我去去就来。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":2,"image":"i740"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我飞奔而去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在炙热的阳光下，凭这一双腿。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为本来只是打算散步的，所以没有骑车，还让我有些后悔。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不，或许跑着去才更好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"骑车的话，或许白羽会察觉到引擎声而逃掉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"要问她什么？该如何去问？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一路向岛郊跑去，同时脑中不停思考着。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":2},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而还没有思考出结论，就已经抵达了目的地……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看到了她正对着海，眺望着远方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"随海风舞动的长发，以及不见丝毫晒痕的雪白肌肤。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而这一切在这场景下反而显得有些异类，仿佛不属于这个尘世一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"甚至让我一时之间不知道该不该去叫她。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉自己明知不可触碰，却还是试图向她伸出手去一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，都到这里了岂能退缩。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13424"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……唉…？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽转头看向了我，原来她正在钓鱼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉气氛有些尴尬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13379"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……什么……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咬钩了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13424"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“哇！啊！上钩！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她猛地一提杆。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一颗星星从海面飞出，漂浮在空中。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……是海星吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13390"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……呃……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你说过钓起来的就要吃掉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……反正海星也挺好吃的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？还真的要吃啊？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13376"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“味道就像海胆一样。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那还是高级食材嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"令人震惊的事实。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13384"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而对话就此中止。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"空气中弥漫着难以言表的尴尬。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个，羽未还等着你来呢。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13373"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我已经说过不做她的妈妈了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我知道这是我单方面的请求……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但是……这也太突然了点。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“之前也是在这里吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13418"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你在这里说出了那句‘最好不要和我扯上关系’。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13426"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“和你说的那个诅咒……有关系吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13408"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……无关。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“无关吗……？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“与你无关。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我希望你不要这样拒人千里之外。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我不觉得与我无关。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13328"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那是你自己的问题……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“昨天……你离开的时候，还说了对不起吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对无关的人是不会说这种话的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13307"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……那…那是……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果有什么缘由，希望你能告诉我。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我想知道。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13284"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那我告诉你之后……希望你不要再接近我了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这我可不能保证。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13262"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那我就不能说……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我就跟着你，直到你肯说。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“…开……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13415"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“死开！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃唔……！好久没挨过了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这句话莫名地极具杀伤力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，我不能就此屈服。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“无论你怎么说，我都想知道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"始终摆出一副不让步的姿态。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13253"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而白羽的表情与其说是生气，更像是在为难。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"终于像是死心了一样，深深地叹了一口气。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13427"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……这岛上的居民，没有谁不知道……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13409"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我是被诅咒的人。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"令人心生不安的一句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你指的是……被孤立了的意思吗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在小岛这种封闭空间中的某种旧习俗吗？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不，不是这样的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13377"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“岛上的居民都是好人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以，我才不想牵连他们……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“牵连……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"莫非，这就是导致白羽一直都是孤身一人的原因……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13236"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我能……看见。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“未来……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i505"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后便听她缓缓道来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而这些话，令人一时之间难以相信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽在很久以前就拥有了神奇的能力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"似乎是一种会“看见”别人的灾厄的能力。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她所看见的东西都会在现实中发生。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而无一例外，发生这些事的人都是她身边的人。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13281"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13275"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“所以至今，我都一直不与任何人亲近……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“但那或许也只是偶然啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13236"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13260"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我之前也尝试过像那样去想。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13305"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但是，无论我怎么做都无法逃避未来。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就像是脚下的道路已经被锁死了一样……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13347"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“只会将我带往那唯一的目的地……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13329"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“就算我想要去改变，想要逃避。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13254"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“每一个行为，都会引导我前往已知的未来……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这些话一时半会很难令人相信。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而……我却意外地信服了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13275"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你一点也不惊讶呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我是挺惊讶的……但是……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13236"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为羽未的事所以信服了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她说得没错。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1442"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"羽未的那本绘图日记。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"虽然给她的时候我还声称是魔法日记本，但接下来感觉到的种种异样感。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1443"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"比如天气情况，是我们无论怎么努力都无法改变的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然而却直至今日，日记上的天气都与实际情况没有任何偏差。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就连下雨，也如同日记上所写的那样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仿佛就像是羽未早就知道在那一天会下雨一样。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“于是我才认识到……果然这世上存在预知未来的能力。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13409"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我看见的那些未来，是无法改变的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“而我真的会在这个夏天……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……唉？你什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13367"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽……你看见什么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18141"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i498"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……漆黑的海……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“天上下着雨……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我在海里看见了这一幕。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在海里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那就是说……溺水了…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“抬头望见的海面上，漂浮着许许多多的红光……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“那是这个岛的海祭，夏鸟之仪。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“今年我负责担任夏鸟，引导先祖们的灵魂顺利回归。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“这件事我还没对任何人说过。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我想到时候一定会发生什么事，导致我沉入海中。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“我感到痛苦……无法呼吸……心脏绞痛……”"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我的身体似乎对白羽的话产生了反应，开始颤抖起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不禁紧紧地闭上双眼，想象黑暗的水底。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉就像心灵要被拽进想象的深渊中一般。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你怎么了……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一声呼唤让我回过神来。"},{"op":"clear","layer":0},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i239"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13305"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"睁开眼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的脸近在眼前。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“你还好吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……抱歉，我没事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"身体还在微微颤抖。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的话以及亲身的体验交织起来，让我所看见了幻觉……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无论逃到哪里都没用吗……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉无论怎么逃，那黑暗的水也会追随我而来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不……不对吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽，你之前有试图反抗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13260"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“反抗……？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“第一次见你的时候，你是在学校的泳池练习游泳吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那难道不是为了溺水也能平安无事吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13427"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“……我只是稍微试着挣扎了一下……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13374"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“但终究只是无用功吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13385"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为羽未告诉了我。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13409"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“未来是不会变的，也是无法改变的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“话不是那样说……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13305"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“不要再来找我了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你为什么要说那种话呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13271"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“因为不想牵连你。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13285"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“遭遇不幸的，只要我一个就够了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13332"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“原本……我就必须要与其他人隔绝。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i51"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13346"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说着说着，白羽步步后退。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13304"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“为了不让任何人被牵连进我的命运……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我想要靠近……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13381"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“然而……还是对不起了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但感觉如果再靠近一步，白羽就会转身逃掉。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i13400"},{"op":"text","speaker":"白羽","text":"“和你们度过的这段时间，我真的很开心……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“白羽！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊啊！我忍不了了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"情不自禁大喊着迈出了步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可白羽却把这个动作当成了一个信号，随即转身逃走。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"明明是为了靠近她才迈出了脚步，却无法追上去。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就像鞋底紧紧黏在了地面一步也挪不动。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而白羽也是头也不回地越跑越远。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我什么都做不到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"白羽的话我没有照单全信……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就是那个逼得白羽孤身一人……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和羽未的感情就此一刀两断了……？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“该死……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对自己的无力而感到悲哀……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]